        "bodySignals": ["Smiling, often breaking into a chuckle or laugh.","Wrinkles around the eyes (crows' feet) from genuine smiling.","Eyes sparkling with mirth.","Relaxed body, sometimes a slight shake of the head.","A feeling of lightness and pleasure.","Snorting or gasping with suppressed laughter."],
        "otherAttributes": "Trigger: Direct response to humor, wit, or entertaining content. | Cognitive: Involves the processing and appreciation of something as funny. | Social: Highly social emotion, often shared and reinforced by others. | Dealing with it: Allow yourself to laugh fully. Share the amusement with others. Seek out sources of lightheartedness."
