        "bodySignals": ["A warm, gentle smile, often with eyes that convey sincerity.","A feeling of warmth in the chest, near the heart.","Relaxed and open posture.","A deep sigh of contentment or relief.","Sometimes tears of appreciation.","A natural inclination to express thanks verbally or through actions."],
        "otherAttributes": "Prosocial: Tends to foster positive social behaviors and strengthen relationships. | Well-being: Strongly linked to psychological well-being and happiness. | Focus: Directs attention to the positive aspects of life or others' actions. | Dealing with it: Express gratitude directly. Keep a gratitude journal. Practice mindfulness to notice things to be grateful for."
