        "valence": 0.8,
        "arousal": 0.4,
        "colorHex": "#FDE047",
        "quadrant": "energized"
    ,
        "definition": "Recognizing the full worth or quality of something or someone; understanding and enjoying the value of something. It's a more cognitive recognition of value, often leading to gratitude.",
